flowchart TB
 T[Durable operation and target] --> STORED{Spotify ID stored?}
 STORED -->|yes| READ
 STORED -->|no| ATT{Create previously attempted?}
 ATT -->|no| INT[Checkpoint create intent]
 INT --> POST[POST /me/playlists with unique marker]
 POST -->|ID received| ID[Persist Spotify ID]
 POST -->|response lost| SCAN[Scan current-user playlists for marker]
 ATT -->|yes / no stored ID| SCAN
 SCAN -->|exactly one valid match| ID
 SCAN -->|none or duplicate| STOP[Incomplete / explicit recovery]
 ID --> READ[Verify owner + remote ordered content + snapshot]
 READ --> PREFIX{Remote is target prefix?}
 PREFIX -->|yes| APPEND[Append next chunk / at most 100]
 PREFIX -->|no| REPLACE[Replace first chunk / at most 100]
 APPEND --> READ
 REPLACE --> READ
 READ -->|complete exact target| META[Preserve name and outside notes / fixed-false metadata PUT]
 META --> VERIFY[Re-read description + snapshot + noncollaboration]
 VERIFY --> READY[Complete operation / ready]